<title>GREECE: Greece posts $456 mln June current account deficit.</title>
<headline>Greece posts $456 mln June current account deficit.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek current account figures provided by the Bank of Greece:</p>
<p>Current account figures provided by the Bank of Greece:</p>
<p> (figures in $million)	June 96    May 96     June 95</p>
<p> Current account		 -456	-801	  -152.8</p>
<p> Trade balance		 -1,371    -1,658	-1,454.8</p>
<p> Invisibles			 915	 857	 1,302</p>
<p> Exports fob			443	 497	   514.4</p>
<p> Imports cif		    1,814     2,155	 1,969</p>
<p> Net capital movement	   642    -2,087	  -284.6</p>
<p> Private sector		    -47	448	    43.3</p>
<p> Public sector		    689    -2,535	  -327.9</p>
<p> Reserves (stock)	     13,031   12,892	  16,547</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
